# ------------------------------------------------------------------ models
# Exported graphs and checkpoints: ~2.6 GB, and all reproducible from
# prune_init.py -> distill.py -> export_student.py -> simplify.py.
pi_optimize_demucs/models/
*.onnx
*.onnx.data
*.pt
*.ckpt

# The two artifacts actually worth keeping are the trained student weights and
# its exported graph. They are too big for git; back them up out of band:
#   pi_optimize_demucs/models/student_distilled_best.pt   (35 MB, SDR 5.44 dB)
#   pi_optimize_demucs/models/student_final_slim.onnx     (56 MB, Pi RTF 0.64x)

